{"id":"n56525-1-8","stage":5,"title":"바래다 · 褪色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56525-1-8-1","ko":"누렇게 바랜 그 사진 뭐야?","zh":"那张发黄的照片是什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누렇게","meaning":"深黄，暗黄","explanation":"누렇다：深黄，暗黄；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"누렇다","audio":"/audio/daf86a8ec746539df1b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45598","senseId":"1","lemma":"누렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누렇게","audio":"/audio/e42878d14dad99c35228.mp3"}},{"text":"바랜","meaning":"褪色，泛黄","explanation":"바래다：褪色，泛黄；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"바래다","audio":"/audio/ee1a783c3bff3bef100d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56525","senseId":"1","lemma":"바래다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바랜","audio":"/audio/a2a194facfb6f9392530.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"사진","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"daf86a8ec746539d","term":"누렇다","zh":"深黄，暗黄","audio":"/audio/daf86a8ec746539df1b5.mp3","entryId":"45598","definition":"比普通的黄色略微浑浊灰暗。","pronunciation":["누ː러타"]},{"id":"ee1a783c3bff3bef","term":"바래다","zh":"褪色，泛黄","audio":"/audio/ee1a783c3bff3bef100d.mp3","entryId":"56525","definition":"因光照或湿气而导致颜色变淡或变黄。","pronunciation":["바ː래다"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/403114c087c9300a2df9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56525-1-8-2","ko":"우리 엄마 젊은 시절 사진이야.","zh":"是我们妈妈年轻时的照片。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"젊은","meaning":"年青，年轻","explanation":"젊다：年青，年轻；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"젊다","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75773","senseId":"1","lemma":"젊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젊은","audio":"/audio/e4426a31984d43e74db2.mp3"}},{"text":"시절","meaning":"时代，岁月","explanation":"시절：时代，岁月","readings":[{"term":"시절","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65302","senseId":"4","lemma":"시절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceRe